        {
            "_id": "gwvpZMih5Q2rp68j",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Steal Shadow",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The shadow collector is adjacent to an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] living creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The shadow collector attempts to pull the creature's shadow from its body. The target must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:26] save.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The collector steals a scrap of the shadow, increasing the size of their shadow menagerie aura by 5 feet for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the aura is increased by 10 feet and the collector steals the target's shadow permanently. The shadow is returned if the shadow collector dies or takes a Dismiss action to release the shadow.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": [
                        "primal",
                        "shadow"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "57FiIv52h0577xdP",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Slip Behind",
            "sort": 800000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The shadow collector slips into a creature's shadow, teleporting to a space adjacent to that creature within 15 feet. The target or its items can't be emitting magical light, and if the target is within an area of magical light the shadow collector must choose a destination that puts the target between them and the light's source.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
